sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Client
  participant P1 as API
  participant P2 as Cache
  participant P3 as Database
  P0->>P1: Read product
  P1->>P2: GET scoped key
  P2-->>P1: Miss
  P1->>P3: Query authoritative product
  P3->>P1: Value and version
  P1->>P2: SET with TTL
  P1->>P0: Product response
